ef=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T01:22:39-07:00","id":1461313,"title":"","content":"-hows the art?<br /> -hows the layout?<br /> -does the book comment on playing sabbat at all?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T01:37:05-07:00","id":1461315,"title":"","content":"<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461313#post1461313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-hows the art?</div> </div> </div> </div>High quality digital drawings, Mark Kelly has done some phenomenal work. It really delivers the idea of madness and anguish<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461313#post1461313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-hows the layout?</div> </div> </div> </div>Very neat and clear!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461313#post1461313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-does the book comment on playing sabbat at all?</div> </div> </div> </div>The book gives really good advice to use the Sabbat as antagonists and Storytelling tools, and in doing so it gives a very clear look of how the Sabbat lives nightly and what themes and situations could arise in a Sabbat story ... but also \u200bclearly and strongly says that you should not make players empathize with the Sabbat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T01:51:21-07:00","id":1461316,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461315#post1461315\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> High quality digital drawings, Mark Kelly has done some phenomenal work. It really delivers the idea of madness and anguish<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Very neat and clear!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> The book gives really good advice to use the Sabbat as antagonists and Storytelling tools, and in doing so it gives a very clear look of how the Sabbat lives nightly and what themes and situations could arise in a Sabbat story ... but also \u200bclearly and strongly says that you should not make players empathize with the Sabbat.</div> </div> </div> </div> That's some positives although I'm tickled by the suggestion you shouldn't emphathize with the Sabbat since I don't really empathise carmilla or anarch vampires either, since the only correct move of the great game in setting is not to play.<br /> <br /> I'm probably going to hold out until a sale but it does at least sound like it's worth a look. Step up from anarchs book but still far from ideal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 09-25-2021, 04:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T03:29:21-07:00","id":1461320,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5#post1461282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They could have easily included a Path system and mechanics for running them rather than just say, &quot;Sabbat don't suffer your puny degeneration unless they are nice to mortals or are other kinds of freaks.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Damn, that was my worst fear. I guess it makes sense then that Sabbat aren't playable if they didn't publish rules to do so and then went out of their way to explicitly note that the rules we -do- have (Humanity) can't be used because no vampires in the sect use those rules.<br /> <br /> I was really hoping we'd get rules, even if not robust ones, for characters following a Path and then the obligatory note that the rules are for NPCs and Sabbat aren't intended to be playable, similar to how we got mechanics for Nephandi and other NPC only factions.<br /> <br /> But yeah, it looks like they went out of their way to lock out the Sabbat as NPC antagonists by ensuring we can't even use the existing rules for them. And that's a damn shame.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 09-25-2021, 06:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T04:26:00-07:00","id":1461322,"title":"","content":"So there aren't rules for paths now? <br /> Whatabout Vauldrie?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T04:36:30-07:00","id":1461323,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461313#post1461313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-hows the art?<br /> -hows the layout?<br /> -does the book comment on playing sabbat at all?</div> </div> </div> </div>1. Very lovely. On par with OPP's books.<br /> <br /> 2. So far so good but the PDF isn't hotlinked yet.<br /> <br /> 3. Yes, it says, &quot;That's not what this book is far.&quot; In triplicate. An entire page basically saying, &quot;Sabbat are brainwashed cultists surrendered completely to the Beast.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461322#post1461322\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So there aren't rules for paths now?<br /> Whatabout Vauldrie?</div> </div> </div> </div>1. There's rules in the context of there NOT being rules. Specifically, the Sabbat are stated to not suffer Stains for the use of &quot;evil&quot; powers (like some of the ones provided), killing mortals, and so on. They also don't have Touchstones. In the descriptions of Paths, it says that they CAN degenerate but the things that cause them to degenerate are wholly alien to Humanity like being upset for killing a human or showing mercy.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">&quot;This does not mean that their emotional compass, while skewed, is absent. An adherent of the Path of Caine who declines a chance at diablerie will feel shame equal to a humane individual betraying a close friend, and a follower of the Path of Power and the Inner Voice will grieve at submitting to a lesser in a way akin to a non-Sabbat causing the death of an innocent. Sabbat vampires still feel, and still bear the consequences of their choices. It\u2019s just that the stimuli for their emotional responses are different than those of Kindred who maintain the illusion of Humanity.&quot;</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> 2. Yeah, it talks a lot about that. Sabbat being all Blood Bound to one another and fanatically brainwashed by it, It states, though, that it may now take 3 drinks to bond you to the pack rather than just one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 09-25-2021, 07:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T07:59:27-07:00","id":1461329,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461322#post1461322\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So there aren't rules for paths now?<br /> Whatabout Vauldrie?</div> </div> </div> </div>There's a sidebar that has a bit about the 'rules' for Paths and stuff, which is basically: there are no rules, because they aren't necessary. The 'fluff' parts CT posted above are more for roleplaying them as antagonists, rather than tied to any dots/etc.<br /> <br /> From the book:<br /> <i>Vampire stories are unlikely to concern themselves with fluctuations in the moral state of Sabbat antagonists. Don\u2019t bother keeping track of their Humanity scores; they don\u2019t have any, and Paths don\u2019t have a trait value governing them. Humanity continues to have paramount importance for players\u2019 characters, however, especially to contrast them against the monstrousness of the Sabbat.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T08:05:50-07:00","id":1461330,"title":"","content":"As such high levels of one-true way wankery. What happens if you the player find yourself attracted to a path (as many anarchs are) or the Sabbat itself? Game over? <br /> <br /> V6 should make honourable accord mandatory, and you can only play coteries of Ravnos.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T08:10:43-07:00","id":1461332,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>elmerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461329#post1461329\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a sidebar that has a bit about the 'rules' for Paths and stuff, which is basically: there are no rules, because they aren't necessary. The 'fluff' parts CT posted above are more for roleplaying them as antagonists, rather than tied to any dots/etc.<br /> <br /> From the book:<br /> <i>Vampire stories are unlikely to concern themselves with fluctuations in the moral state of Sabbat antagonists. Don\u2019t bother keeping track of their Humanity scores; they don\u2019t have any, and Paths don\u2019t have a trait value governing them. Humanity continues to have paramount importance for players\u2019 characters, however, especially to contrast them against the monstrousness of the Sabbat.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>So by my translation\u2026 \u201cif you like to play Sabbat, stick with V20 and just adapt whatever fluff from this you find compelling to it because it\u2019s never going to be something V5 supports.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T08:44:35-07:00","id":1461336,"title":"","content":"The PDF is expensive. Is the book worth getting if I do <i>not </i>intend to run a game involving the Sabbat anytime soon?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T10:04:05-07:00","id":1461348,"title":"","content":"I once again hold that the existing Humanity system is perfectly capable of handling paths. Pick three tenets that exemplify your path and don't use the word &quot;Humanity&quot;. People in-universe shouldn't throw around that word anyway, much less talk about distinct ratings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12892-kammerer","name":"Kammerer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12892_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T10:47:18-07:00","id":1461359,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461336#post1461336\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The PDF is expensive. Is the book worth getting if I do <i>not </i>intend to run a game involving the Sabbat anytime soon?</div> </div> </div> </div>I believe the book is very good content but it is notably very short for its price. I paid the extra ten dollars because if I'm going to pay that much for a book, it'd better be in hardback rather than PDF.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T10:50:16-07:00","id":1461360,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461332#post1461332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So by my translation\u2026 \u201cif you like to play Sabbat, stick with V20 and just adapt whatever fluff from this you find compelling to it because it\u2019s never going to be something V5 supports.\u201d</div> </div> </div> </div>I think this speaks for itself:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">&quot;The presentation of the Sabbat for the Fifth Edition of Vampire is as antagonists. The Sword of Caine is undeniably a monstrous evil that even the Kindred fear, a sect of vampire supremacists who set aside the perspectives of the still-living, believing themselves to be more than mortals.<br /> <br /> This manifests as deliberate efforts by the Sabbat to crush individual identity and reshape it to the sect\u2019s own apocalyptic ends. Ultimately, Sabbat vampires don\u2019t have a choice in many of the actions they take. In giving themselves to the Beast, they\u2019ve set aside that central riddle of the Kindred condition.<br /> <br /> One of the core ironies \u2014 or hypocrisies, if you will \u2014 of being Sabbat is that it attempts to overthrow oppression through fanatical servility to Caine. As members of the Black Hand, Cainites yield individuality, ambition, autonomy. They are Blood Bound, indoctrinated, completely deindividuated, and instilled with hatreds to which they turn no critical thought.<br /> <br /> To be clear, there are no systems or suggestions included herein for portraying the Sabbat as a player\u2019s character.&quot;</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Points for using the word deindividuated.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T11:08:53-07:00","id":1461365,"title":"","content":"My read is:<br /> <br /> &quot;We think brainwashed people in the hands of cults or extremism religion aren't individuals anymore, nor humans, just a mockery of life, and we strongly condemn any person wanting to empathize with mockeries.&quot;<br /> <br /> Is there any way for me to be clearer that I <b><u>really</u></b> don't like the lack of Humanity in the Sabbat nor this whole &quot;antagonists only&quot; take?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T11:14:27-07:00","id":1461369,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461365#post1461365\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My read is:<br /> <br /> &quot;We think brainwashed people in the hands of cults or extremism religion aren't individuals anymore, nor humans, just a mockery of life, and we strongly condemn any person wanting to empathize with mockeries.&quot;<br /> <br /> Is there any way for me to be clearer that I <b><u>really</u></b> don't like the lack of Humanity in the Sabbat nor this whole &quot;antagonists only&quot; take?</div> </div> </div> </div>Add in addition to that descriptor that they are brainwashed extremist religious cult <i>terrorists</i>.<br /> <br /> In which case that opinion is unfortunately going to probably be the majority.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T11:25:12-07:00","id":1461372,"title":"","content":"So, my problem is I want to actually play a vampire that wants to build a society for vampires, with vampire politics and vampire philosophies and that used to be the Sabbat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27090-jonny","name":"Jonny","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T11:27:26-07:00","id":1461373,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jonny</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461372#post1461372\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, my problem is I want to actually play a vampire that wants to build a society for vampires, with vampire politics and vampire philosophies and that used to be the Sabbat.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well it was always a undercurrent that the Sabbat's violent savage brutal side was potentially able to overthrow the cultured alien side. It just finally did. I think some fans forgot the Sabbat's claim they were posthuman erudite transhumans was never the majority of the sect.<br /> <br /> Archbishop: Why do we deny ourselves the blood? Why do we seek to emulate the mortals we have transcended? Why do...Dave...Dave....stop chewing on the baby. Ellenore, please puts some clothes on.<br /> <br /> Here's some Ministry pamphlets.<br /> <br /> They have some good works.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T11:42:37-07:00","id":1461377,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461373#post1461373\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well it was always a undercurrent that the Sabbat's violent savage brutal side was potentially able to overthrow the cultured alien side. It just finally did. I think some fans forgot the Sabbat's claim they were posthuman erudite transhumans was never the majority of the sect.<br /> <br /> Archbishop: Why do we deny ourselves the blood? Why do we seek to emulate the mortals we have transcended? Why do...Dave...Dave....stop chewing on the baby. Ellenore, please puts some clothes on.<br /> <br /> Here's some Ministry pamphlets.<br /> <br /> They have some good works.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, I get that. So, I'm coming to all this late tbf but it seems the Sabbat used to be a hodgepodge of all these different ideas of vampire politics and philosophy but the core was always the apocalyptic cult. Now, with all the changes brought on by the 2nd Inquisition and civil war, etc. They have jettisoned a lot of &quot;baggage&quot; and probably in their own eyes purified the Sabbat back to it's core ideal. Which in some ways is sad, but also in other ways might be useful. With the Ministry and Tzrmisce going to the Anarch Movement, I can kind of bootstrap a lot of the ideas I find interesting to it. I just hope they give us more to work with by fleshing out the Anarchs in the future.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27090-jonny","name":"Jonny","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T11:46:31-07:00","id":1461380,"title":"","content":"As someone who runs sabbat games in New York for over a decade now...I'd rather not have them be religious zealot terrorists. Which pre v5 they were not. If someone wants to play them that way as very 2 dimensional bad guys...go for it. Call my crazy but telling my new york players nah you are all now religious zealot terrorists now in that thing you love...not gonna work for me. For very obvious reasons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3215-supersabbatst","name":"SuperSabbatST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"196"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T11:51:49-07:00","id":1461381,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461369#post1461369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Add in addition to that descriptor that they are brainwashed extremist religious cult <i>terrorists</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you can't empathize with terrorists enough to understand why they turned that way, then you can't help yourself but foment ever more hatred and terrorism against yourself. You may also not notice the thin line between condemning terrorism and conflating an entire religion/ideology with terrorism. Not to talk about the many people around the world that aren't extremists, but had loved ones brainwashed by extremism, cults and conspiracy theories, and need help to rescue their loved ones or at least ensure that others won't have to go through the same.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T12:12:37-07:00","id":1461388,"title":"","content":"Honestly, if the Week of Madness was used to explain why the Sabbat descended into that state of, well, utter madness, I'd prefer it. It's basically ONE Antediluvian who woke up and the cold hard truth is that the Sword of Caine wouldn't have been to stop him. And Ravnos is probably not the most outwardly destructive of the lot. It should have been enough to send shivers down the whole sect, and combined with the Gehenna war going on, it'd be terrible for the Sabbat.<br /> <br /> I could see a schism following it, with the Lasombra going &quot;Okay, we certainly didn't kill our own Ante, we're ditching this shit, we will al be destroyed if we go toe to toe with them&quot; and the Tzimisce fitting against the most extreme elements, who are mostly just monstrous from the start and feel that they need to become even more in order to have some hope of defeating the Antediluvians. <br /> <br /> So, a three way schism : Lasombra going toward the Camarilla for, well, protection; Tzimisce going anarchs because they fucking hate Tremere and want to create a new vampiric society anyway while the maddest of the Sabbat remain and get madder by the night. <br /> <br /> Individual anti-tribes would join either of the splinters, and it could be interesting to have a whole bunch of former Sabbats joining the Anarchs and going &quot;we were always the real Anarchs anyway&quot; on the rest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","name":"Ur-Than","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T12:19:43-07:00","id":1461392,"title":"","content":"Renegade still doesn't seem able to ship to me in the UK. So I can't preorder the book. Which means I'd have to buy the PDF and then buy the book separately later on? I really don't want to do that.<br /> <br /> Is there any way I can buy the book here in the UK and get immediate access to the PDF? Or buy the PDF and upgrade my order after?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T12:22:20-07:00","id":1461393,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ur-Than</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461388#post1461388\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> it could be interesting to have a whole bunch of former Sabbats joining the Anarchs and going &quot;we were always the real Anarchs anyway&quot; on the rest.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;OK kids its time to get organized. Have you heard of the old Anarch tradition of Vaulderie?...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27090-jonny","name":"Jonny","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T12:25:15-07:00","id":1461394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jonny</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461393#post1461393\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;OK kids is time to get organized. Have you heard of the old Anarch tradition of Vaulderie?...&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> &quot;No Jace, i'm not saying we should diablerized all the Antediluvians to make a better vampiric society. But I think we should think about it. What, Ellen ? Yes, she's chewing at... hum... let's not get into the details, shall we? Being Anarch is to accept one's... particularities, right?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","name":"Ur-Than","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T12:31:19-07:00","id":1461395,"title":"","content":"Personally I'm tickled by the books presumptions that the Anarchs and the Carmarilla arnt also vampiric supremacists with hypocritical awful beliefs and a massive body count.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 09-25-2021, 03:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T12:39:40-07:00","id":1461399,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461395#post1461395\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Personally I'm tickled by the books presumptions that the Anarchs and the Carmarilla arnt also vampiric supremacists with hypocritical awful beliefs and a massive body count.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, but they're free-range meat eaters. Sabbat want everyone in pens and cruelty-filled mass production.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461381#post1461381\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you can't empathize with terrorists enough to understand why they turned that way, then you can't help yourself but foment ever more hatred and terrorism against yourself. You may also not notice the thin line between condemning terrorism and conflating an entire religion/ideology with terrorism. Not to talk about the many people around the world that aren't extremists, but had loved ones brainwashed by extremism, cults and conspiracy theories, and need help to rescue their loved ones or at least ensure that others won't have to go through the same.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep.<br /> <br /> However, I don't disagree that by the time you are inside the Sabbat, you probably aren't ever getting out.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuperSabbatST</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461380#post1461380\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As someone who runs sabbat games in New York for over a decade now...I'd rather not have them be religious zealot terrorists. Which pre v5 they were not. If someone wants to play them that way as very 2 dimensional bad guys...go for it. Call my crazy but telling my new york players nah you are all now religious zealot terrorists now in that thing you love...not gonna work for me. For very obvious reasons.</div> </div> </div> </div>Did you ever play Under a Blood Red Moon?<br /> <br /> I love the Sabbat. My 2nd favorite sect but when have they EVER not been diablerie hungry terrorists?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 09-25-2021, 03:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T13:06:51-07:00","id":1461405,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuperSabbatST</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461380#post1461380\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As someone who runs sabbat games in New York for over a decade now...I'd rather not have them be religious zealot terrorists. Which pre v5 they were not. If someone wants to play them that way as very 2 dimensional bad guys...go for it. Call my crazy but telling my new york players nah you are all now religious zealot terrorists now in that thing you love...not gonna work for me. For very obvious reasons.</div> </div> </div> </div>For V5 you just don't run Sabbat games anymore, you run ex-Sabbat Anarch games. And instead of telling your players they're all religious zealots now, you tell them the religious zealots finally did it and broke the sect, you're all Anarchs now, have fun losing the entire sect's support and you're lucky if most local Sabbat just go Anarch with you and keep some semblance of normalcy.<br /> <br /> Oh, don't forget to dump your paths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T13:16:36-07:00","id":1461407,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461405#post1461405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For V5 you just don't run Sabbat games anymore, you run ex-Sabbat Anarch games. And instead of telling your players they're all religious zealots now, you tell them the religious zealots finally did it and broke the sect, you're all Anarchs now, have fun losing the entire sect's support and you're lucky if most local Sabbat just go Anarch with you and keep some semblance of normalcy.<br /> <br /> Oh, don't forget to dump your paths.</div> </div> </div> </div>A complaint I made in other forums is the lack of Loresheets that could have filled in that missing 70 pages. Even if you don't have the Sabbat as player characters, these would have been good ones:<br /> <br /> * <b>Sabbat Defector: </b>You are a former member of the Sabbat that has turned to the Anarchs or Camarilla for whatever reason. Maybe ***** would be, &quot;Path Inclinations&quot; which gives you a resistance to Stains for violence.<br /> * <b>Crusade Defender: </b>You have survived a couple of Sabbat Crusades and fought off the Black Hand. You now have insights into their tactics.<br /> * <b>Ritae Master:</b> You know the secrets of Sabbat rituals that are not known by other Kindred like how to perform the Vaulderie.<br /> * <b>Lucita's Brood: </b>You are descended from Lucita of Aragon even if you do not follow her path as she had many childer before she defected to the Sabbat.<br /> * <b>Vykos' Brood: </b>You are descended from some of Vykos' brood that defected to the Anarchs or Camarilla.<br /> <br /> I mean, seriously, these are just off the top of my head.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T13:33:22-07:00","id":1461410,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461407#post1461407\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A complaint I made in other forums is the lack of Loresheets that could have filled in that missing 70 pages.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's astounding that they didn't do it, this was surely a no-brainer to make. Sabbat Defector alone is pretty much necessary for the current lore and to help so many groups in this situation of wanting to allude to their characters' connections to the Sabbat.<br /> <br /> And despite their role in the sect, it is strange for example that no Anarchs ever tried to learn at the very least the secrets of the Vaulderie, which is one of the coolest basic ritae and incredibly non-offensive (I mean, unless you find drinking blood offensive, in which case you shouldn't be playing this game).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T13:33:33-07:00","id":1461411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461381#post1461381\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you can't empathize with terrorists enough to understand why they turned that way, then you can't help yourself but foment ever more hatred and terrorism against yourself. You may also not notice the thin line between condemning terrorism and conflating an entire religion/ideology with terrorism. Not to talk about the many people around the world that aren't extremists, but had loved ones brainwashed by extremism, cults and conspiracy theories, and need help to rescue their loved ones or at least ensure that others won't have to go through the same.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, I think V5 makes this distinction quite clearly: if you want to be a gnostic noddist, or a feminist transhumanist, you can join the Church of Caine or the Bahari, without the need for being a serial diablerist. <br /> <br /> If you want to crush the Elders, and maybe become a serial diablerist, without flaying the innocents, you can join the Anarchs. <br /> <br /> Camarilla Elysia are now places where the Masquerade is suspended in favour of vampiric self-expression as anachronistic blood sucking monsters. <br /> <br /> <br /> So, the &quot;mainstream parts&quot; of Sabbat ideology have moved to other sects and factions, due to Sabbat Civil War, Gehenna Crusade and Second Inquisition efforts: those staying in the Sabbat are the hardcore, ISIS-like or whitesuprematist-like terrorists, with whom you will want to talk only at safe distance and after a sound deprogramming.<br /> <br /> There is also room for some quite evil aspects of the old Sabbat: the Circulatory System, which honestly I find abhorrent and evil enough, is the perfect place for Kyasid alchemists and mixologists, Lasombra Kings and Queens of the Night, the Order of Saint Blaise or Tzimisce Revenants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12590,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","user":"Manfr","date":". 09-25-2021, 04:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T13:34:57-07:00","id":1461412,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461410#post1461410\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's astounding that they didn't do it, this was surely a no-brainer to make. Sabbat Defector alone is pretty much necessary for the current lore and to help so many groups in this situation of wanting to allude to their characters' connections to the Sabbat.<br /> <br /> And despite their role in the sect, it is strange for example that no Anarchs ever tried to learn at the very least the secrets of the Vaulderie, which is one of the coolest basic ritae and incredibly non-offensive (I mean, unless you find drinking blood offensive, in which case you shouldn't be playing this game).</div> </div> </div> </div>This, I agree very much, the lack of loresheets is very problematic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T13:36:51-07:00","id":1461413,"title":"","content":"I am very much a V5 supporter but there's no reason this book shouldn't be longer and even if they are 100% on the &quot;No Sabbat PCs ever!&quot; thing then there's still plenty more they could have included for the price they're charging.<br /> <br /> * The Sabbat Inquisition (what happened to it)<br /> * The Black Hand (what happened to it)<br /> * The Week of Nightmares<br /> * The Ravnos (they have no Antediluvian)<br /> * Loresheets<br /> * Path Rules (which are for NPCS! Honest!)<br /> <br /> And so on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 09-25-2021, 04:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T13:45:18-07:00","id":1461416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461405#post1461405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For V5 you just don't run Sabbat games anymore, you run ex-Sabbat Anarch games. And instead of telling your players they're all religious zealots now, you tell them the religious zealots finally did it and broke the sect, you're all Anarchs now, have fun losing the entire sect's support and you're lucky if most local Sabbat just go Anarch with you and keep some semblance of normalcy.<br /> <br /> Oh, don't forget to dump your paths.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that in V5 you can run a range of very interesting and varied post-Sabbat games, all grounded in both the previous lore on the Sect and in the lore from the new edition. <br /> <br /> The problem I see is that V5 faction books so far have all provided many plot hooks which are vague enough to not make it overtly complicated to newbies, but explicit enough that, following breadcrumbs in the last 30 years of manuals, you can connect the dots and see the links with metaplot. <br /> <br /> Problem is, this vagueness is often a bit too thick, for old players' tastes, and I find it perfectly understandable. <br /> <br /> They should go back at making some fluff, in character videos: probably Matthew Dawkins is too busy making the most wonderful books out there to give us weekly noddist riddles by Roger de Camden, but we could always hear honeyed lies by a Setite Outstar!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12590,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","user":"Manfr","date":". 09-25-2021, 04:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T13:52:48-07:00","id":1461417,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461413#post1461413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am very much a V5 supporter but there's no reason this book shouldn't be longer and even if they are 100% on the &amp;quot;No Sabbat PCs ever!&amp;quot; thing then there's still plenty more they could have included for the price they're charging.<br /> <br /> * The Sabbat Inquisition (what happened to it)<br /> * The Black Hand (what happened to it)<br /> * The Week of Nightmares<br /> * The Ravnos (they have no Antediluvian)<br /> * Loresheets<br /> * Path Rules (which are for NPCS! Honest!)<br /> <br /> And so on.</div> </div> </div> </div>I had always thought that, with their Antediluvian dead and Lasombra defecting, Ravnos would have risen to prominence in the Sabbat as heralds of Gehenna: after all, they were literal survivors to Clan Apocalypse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T14:06:08-07:00","id":1461418,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461411#post1461411\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">those staying in the Sabbat are the hardcore, ISIS-like or whitesuprematist-like terrorists, with whom you will want to talk only at safe distance and after a sound deprogramming.</div> </div> </div> </div>First, phrasings like <i>&quot;Ultimately, Sabbat vampires don\u2019t have a choice in many of the actions they take. In giving themselves to the Beast, they\u2019ve set aside that central riddle of the Kindred condition.&quot;</i> don't give the impression that the authors think a deprogramming is possible.<br /> <br /> Second, if they did, then being able to play Sabbat members, especially one's with still some shreds of Humanity, would be a far better representation of how those things work and a recognition that people in such a state are still people.<br /> <br /> Like how people sometimes leave Scientology, QAnon and ISIS, after a long time of suffering while their twisted beliefs conflict with their actual best interests, and would also respect the feelings of their loved ones that desperately want to get them back.<br /> <br /> The Sabbat isn't a RL terrorist group, but fiction is a means for us to understand and explore reality. By making the Sabbat unplayable and the existence of conflicted members impossible they're barring an important avenue for exploration and a tacit statement about their world view. Given the context and proportions, the former is far more problematic than the later, since it is just a game, but the later is still problematic nonetheless and something that really ticks me off.<br /> <br /> It is too easy to write-off extremists as non-human and don't think further about it. And that's exactly what they did.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461416#post1461416\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that in V5 you can run a range of very interesting and varied post-Sabbat games, all grounded in both the previous lore on the Sect and in the lore from the new edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree and that's implicit on that post, but it doesn't change that for a lot of old Sabbat groups it'll rub the wrong way nevertheless. They'll <b>indeed</b> be told that to play by the lore they will have to dump the Sabbat, staying is not an option.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T14:20:23-07:00","id":1461420,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461418#post1461418\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First, phrasings like <i>&quot;Ultimately, Sabbat vampires don\u2019t have a choice in many of the actions they take. In giving themselves to the Beast, they\u2019ve set aside that central riddle of the Kindred condition.&quot;</i> don't give the impression that the authors think a deprogramming is possible.</div> </div> </div> </div>It actually says its possible but that it requires you to get someone out of the Sabbat, away from the Vinculum, Ritae, and so on. Also, the further your Path is away from humanity, the harder it is to switch.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">No few Anarchs in LA were previously Sabbat who got the fuck out of Tijuana when the Black Hand threw itself into the Gehenna War; the Anarchs of Tangier have seen firsthand the servants of the Ancients and many have converted to the Black Hand on the spot</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The notion of leaving Paths entirely provokes revulsion from the Sabbat. After all, no True Sabbat would turn their back on the sect to adopt such a feeble attitude of cowering among mortals and pretending to hold their values dear. Does the wolf secretly yearn to live as a swine? Risible. Doing so is, not to put too fine a point on it, excruciating.<br /> <br /> [snip]<br /> <br /> It is exceedingly likely that most attempts (of which there are likely an exceedingly small number in the first place) simply fail, leaving the Cainite a wight or\u2026 worse. To be sure, the Sabbat has very little interest in \u201crehabilitating\u201d Path members, as Paths are a defining characteristic of sect allegiance. Other sects are themselves often too paranoid about turncoats, deep-cover spies, hidden double-agents, and other perils of attempting to repatriate one-time Sabbat to place any faith in deprogramming. There\u2019s no silver-bullet methodology or proven curriculum by which to make one\u2019s way back from the terrors of the Paths.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Speculation among the Sword of Caine is rampant as regards the exodus of Lasombra from the sect. Some argue that many Lasombra upheld \u201cHumanity-adjacent\u201d Paths such as the Path of Honorable Accord, which weren\u2019t really in line with Sabbat attitudes anyway, so their self-aggrandized \u201cdark chivalries\u201d didn\u2019t actually have far to travel in order to realign with Humanity. Other Cainites, as with so many Sabbat perspectives, see the talons of the Antediluvians at work, suggesting that Lasombra leadership of the sect was a centuries-long ruse orchestrated by the Ancients to leave the Sword of Caine abandoned as the Gehenna War gained momentum.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 09-25-2021, 05:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T14:33:24-07:00","id":1461424,"title":"","content":"Well, if the Lasombra left the Sabbat for the Camarilla and a lot of Loyalists and Tzimisce left for the Anarchs then that proves that they can be deprogrammed or at the very least the beliefs weren't that incompatible with the beliefs of those sects to begin with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27090-jonny","name":"Jonny","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T15:12:11-07:00","id":1461425,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jonny</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461424#post1461424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, if the Lasombra left the Sabbat for the Camarilla and a lot of Loyalists and Tzimisce left for the Anarchs then that proves that they can be deprogrammed or at the very least the beliefs weren't that incompatible with the beliefs of those sects to begin with.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bit of a mixed message there.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T18:15:47-07:00","id":1461452,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">I've purchased the book but I didn't find a mention of Alamut being destroyed. The story about Alamut is written in character by a member of the Banu Haqim who declares that &quot;Alamut is lost&quot;. Then he makes some outlandish claims about Ur Shulgi's age (older than the second generation? Or is it Saulot?). It's the epitome of the unreliable narrator and it's pretty clear the village near Alamut is empty but the actual fortress has disappeared or is unapproachable and it seems a demonic ritual of some kind has been enacted. As I understand it, the story hints that Ur Shulgi did something and moved Alamut away from its previous location. If you consider that Assamite Revisited and Libellus Sanguinis 3 suggest that Alamut might be a Demon Bastion Haqim made his own it makes sense that Ur Shulgi moved it away or made it impossible to enter for those not following his cult.<br /> That is, unless I'm missing something. I just bought the PDF and mostly skimmed through it.</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24992-haquim","name":"Haquim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T18:26:54-07:00","id":1461456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Haquim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461452#post1461452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">I've purchased the book but I didn't find a mention of Alamut being destroyed. The story about Alamut is written in character by a member of the Banu Haqim who declares that &quot;Alamut is lost&quot;. Then he makes some outlandish claims about Ur Shulgi's age (older than the second generation? Or is it Saulot?). It's the epitome of the unreliable narrator and it's pretty clear the village near Alamut is empty but the actual fortress has disappeared or is unapproachable and it seems a demonic ritual of some kind has been enacted. As I understand it, the story hints that Ur Shulgi did something and moved Alamut away from its previous location. If you consider that Assamite Revisited and Libellus Sanguinis 3 suggest that Alamut might be a Demon Bastion Haqim made his own it makes sense that Ur Shulgi moved it away or made it impossible to enter for those not following his cult.<br /> That is, unless I'm missing something. I just bought the PDF and mostly skimmed through it.</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>I mean it says that Ur-Shulgi is battling a Three-Eyed Witch (Salubri ancient?) and a massive storm of the dead. Oh and all of the houses where the mortals live have claw marks on them. Which is important because vampires need blood to live. I think whatever the situation in Alamut is that it is no longer operating on gritty urban fantasy rules but Mage 2nd Edition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T19:39:44-07:00","id":1461467,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461417#post1461417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I had always thought that, with their Antediluvian dead and Lasombra defecting, Ravnos would have risen to prominence in the Sabbat as heralds of Gehenna: after all, they were literal survivors to Clan Apocalypse.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> In my head Ravnos have always been Anarch, it's just they don't have an organised political structure that would come out and state that offically and instead just do it on a personal basis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27090-jonny","name":"Jonny","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T20:40:55-07:00","id":1461471,"title":"","content":"One interesting thing is the Vaulderie is no longer permanent--which is how it should be:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>Re: Scouts</b><br /> <br /> While this role often ends up as the duty of those at the bottom rung of the pack, it nevertheless demands a certain amount of trustworthiness, as the Cainite is expected to operate without regular observance of the Vaulderie. This can result in scouts feeling alienated from their packs, and going rogue or abandoning their duties entirely. Sometimes these deserters end up as autarkis or even defect if anyone can be bothered to bring them in from the cold, as it were.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T20:58:43-07:00","id":1461473,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461456#post1461456\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean it says that Ur-Shulgi is battling a Three-Eyed Witch (Salubri ancient?)...</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe the Three Eye Witch is Hun Saulot (P'o Saulot is either in SI custody or trapped in the rubble of the Tremere chantry). I can't think of many other vampires with power and interest to fight Ur Shulgi.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T21:12:34-07:00","id":1461474,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461425#post1461425\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Bit of a mixed message there.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not really seeing it.<br /> <br /> The book appears to say that any vampires capable or willing to return to humanity have already done so. The vampires who remain in the Sabbat are pretty much universally unrepentant, untrustworthy monsters. The book seems to take the out-of-character stance that there's shouldn't be any serious dilemma or quandary with the players and Storyteller treating the vampires in the Sabbat the same as they would treat monsters in any other RPG.<br /> <br /> hat's why it spends so much time saying why the vampires still in the Sabbat can't be &quot;redeemed,&quot; they can't be trusted, you can't really interact with them in a positive way. Essentially it feels like the book is treating the members of the Sabbat are more like intelligent wights (even to the point of stating that taking on a Path is &quot;giving into the beast&quot;) than anything else and the book encourages the ST and players to treat them that way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T21:35:12-07:00","id":1461476,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1461474#post1461474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not really seeing it.<br /> <br /> The book appears to say that any vampires capable or willing to return to humanity have already done so. The vampires who remain in the Sabbat are pretty much universally unrepentant, untrustworthy monsters. The book seems to take the out-of-character stance that there's shouldn't be any serious dilemma or quandary with the players and Storyteller treating the vampires in the Sabbat the same as they would treat monsters in any other RPG.<br /> <br /> hat's why it spends so much time saying why the vampires still in the Sabbat can't be &quot;redeemed,&quot; they can't be trusted, you can't really interact with them in a positive way. Essentially it feels like the book is treating the members of the Sabbat are more like intelligent wights (even to the point of stating that taking on a Path is &quot;giving into the beast&quot;) than anything else and the book encourages the ST and players to treat them that way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, they go a long way to talk about the philosophies and behavior of the Sabbat.<br /> <br /> They're evil but not unintelligent.<br /> <br /> But they're meant to be TERRIFYING and the book goes a long way to that.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link"