/a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 10-01-2021, 01:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-30T22:31:53-07:00","id":1462233,"title":"","content":"See I can actually understand the idea of &quot;don't tie clans to sect&quot; and again go the requiem route. You pick a clan and covenant (sect). I am personally not a fan of how they went about it in V5. I would have had all 3 sects be playable and not so much at each other's throats so you could allow for cross sect interaction between players. There's stories ways it could have been done. It's actually pretty easy. The second Inquisition happens and the sect leaders sit down and go...yo real talk...we can't got to war with each other anymore like we did or we all die. Bing bam new treaty. They aren't besties now but have to learn to coexist or be destroyed by a greater outside threat.<br /> <br /> Of all the things they took from requiem for v5...I wish they had taken that lol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3215-supersabbatst","name":"SuperSabbatST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"196"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-30T22:32:48-07:00","id":1462234,"title":"","content":"Hahaha grand soccer...thanks for the game of instinct idea to run lawl","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3215-supersabbatst","name":"SuperSabbatST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"196"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-30T22:58:12-07:00","id":1462235,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462231#post1462231\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;The Cam has all the Sabbat options now so you don't really need the Cam&quot;<br /> <br /> Except that ruins the Cam. <br /> And we still don't have paths in the Cam</div> </div> </div> </div>This. If we had rules for Paths so I could play a Camarilla Tzimisci on the Path of Metamorphosis, not being able to play in the Sabbat, while still a bitter pill to swallow, would be almost tolerable. But as is it just sucks all around. <br /> <br /> Maybe some day we'll get playable Paths. The Hecata, the Ministry and other non-Camarilla, non-Sabbat groups should still have their Paths available to them. And unlike the Sabbat you should be able to play them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-30T23:02:31-07:00","id":1462236,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462235#post1462235\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This. If we had rules for Paths so I could play a Camarilla Tzimisci on the Path of Metamorphosis, not being able to play in the Sabbat, while still a bitter pill to swallow, would be almost tolerable. But as is it just sucks all around.<br /> <br /> Maybe some day we'll get playable Paths. The Hecata, the Ministry and other non-Camarilla, non-Sabbat groups should still have their Paths available to them. And unlike the Sabbat you should be able to play them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I definitely agree.<br /> <br /> At the very least post the rules in the book for NPCs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-30T23:09:12-07:00","id":1462238,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462147#post1462147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Paths make the horror, and serve as a great analogy of how shit goes to fuckery<br /> Humanity keeps vampires nice. It restrains them, it keeps them from doing really bad things... that greatly gets in the way of horror. Imagine a slasher flick where the killer wants to kill his victims as painlessly and as humanely as possible, or better yet, spends half the run time angsting about the one or two murders he plans to commit... that's not anywhere near so scary as a psycho sexual torture enthusiast. As the later can be just as introspective as the former, the former doesn't have advantages. But most vampires aren't slashers, they're worse, they're politicians. A greedy politician with a moral bottom line is bad, but it's not horror. It becomes horror when his morality is entirely alien to the common people and he's willing or even delighted to screw everyone else in his ambition. Horror comes from the unknown. It comes from extremes, it comes from separation. An Emo is more a threat to himself than to the rest of humanity, how does he scare other people? &quot;Personal horror&quot; is personal and it's not going to work if you thrust your own stupid issues onto someone else, but a horror that targets everyone? That's worthwhile.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Except Paths are mostly used to side-step all the difficulties Humanities are meant to put on your Vampire. From my limited experience, they were far more a way to shift the game entirely away from horror for some sort of torture-porn or action flick.<br /> <br /> And I have a hard time understanding how Humanity is preventing you to be a scheming bastard even willing to have people murdered. Perhaps it's because I'm mostly a Requiem player but it isn't really that hard to build up a pure monster on Humanity only. In fact I find it far more frightening because that's what the so-called &quot;monsters&quot; of the real world are : humans. They don't have Paths and what not, they don't need to act in horrendous ways.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","name":"Ur-Than","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-30T23:44:57-07:00","id":1462239,"title":"","content":"You mean paths allow vampires struggling with morality to adapt their moral compass to something more suited for them? You mean this isn't just a parody of how horrible people in real life completely change their own moral outlook in order to suit their own ends? <i>Of fucking course</i> it's going to be used by players to sidestep difficulties of humanity, THAT IS THE POINT. Every time this argument gets brought up, I can't help but think how early man must have dealt with a lot of shit when he developed bowls and spoons and started eating soups, his fellow primitives outraged that he would have the gal to try make life easier for himself.<br /> <br /> IDK about you, I'm not into Torture porn, but given it's a game and we're all relatively responsible people who realize it's such, but if everyone's cool with the torture porn enthusiast at the table, it's fair game, and if not, you should bring it up to the GM. If people enjoy the game, the themes don't matter, torture porn or action extravaganzas are great when everyone's having fun. Maybe the problem is the player who only wants his party to cry rivers of blood and wallow in angst.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-30T23:58:03-07:00","id":1462240,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462239#post1462239\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You mean paths allow vampires struggling with morality to adapt their moral compass to something more suited for them?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, an evil being that should disgust all vampires who aren't evil.<br /> <br /> Which is the fun.<br /> <br /> You embrace being irredeemable.<br /> <br /> And with FLOURISH!<br /> <br /> But everyone, including yourself, should be aware you're ten kinds of scum.<br /> <br /> Mind you, I wonder if that's why I'm so upset Infernalism isn't a bigger part of Sabbat write-ups. I don't have any problem with Sabbat who make deals with the Devil to gain power since I see that as something they would willingly so and at the mere price of their souls. After all, what does one of the Damned need with one anyway?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T00:16:23-07:00","id":1462241,"title":"","content":"I don't know about that. Honourable accord is a very good path for a society. And it was historically probably the most popular path outside of humanity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T00:30:28-07:00","id":1462242,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462229#post1462229\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I could well be 100% wrong in what I've heard and the scuttlebutt is completely inaccurate. I will say, though, maybe the guy in charge of LARP Sabbat might have a biased view.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I stand corrected on Sabbat not being as popular in LARP, though.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Last time I did LARP was about 15 years ago, but it was mostly Sabbat with some Cam (ran on different nights, at different bars) We had had huge problems with various anarch players, to the extent the faction had got banned tho.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T00:54:37-07:00","id":1462244,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462242#post1462242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Last time I did LARP was about 15 years ago, but it was mostly Sabbat with some Cam (ran on different nights, at different bars) We had had huge problems with various anarch players, to the extent the faction had got banned tho.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, it sounds like your Anarchs were less interested in roleplaying than being disruptive assholes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462241#post1462241\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know about that. Honourable accord is a very good path for a society. And it was historically probably the most popular path outside of humanity.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are we discussing Honorable Accord or Chivalry?<br /> <br /> One thing that is notable about V:TM Revised vs. V:TDA is the fact the two takes on Paths vs. Roads are completely irreconciable. In V:TM Revised, humanity is the natural state of mankind and vampires to the point that it requires a huge amount of self-brainwashing to achieve it. Going against it is a form of insanity and it is arguably not that much better than Humanity because while you don't get dragged down for murder and mayhem, you get dragged down for all the other things you have to seperate yourself from.<br /> <br /> Roads in V:TDA are basically a much more &quot;morality is in the eye of the beholder&quot; style system with the idea being that Humanity is just Western Christianity and that it is only recently that &quot;Humanity&quot; has become a popular road with the previous ones being ones that had far different values systems. It treats Roads as every bit as valid as Humanity and has a deep skepticism that leaving them behind is good for the Kindred race.<br /> <br /> You can't have two more different takes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 10-01-2021, 03:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T00:58:12-07:00","id":1462245,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462244#post1462244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, it sounds like your Anarchs were less interested in roleplaying than being disruptive assholes.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Pretty much. Tho it was worse than assholes, and now would be prosecuted (rightly) level of unwanted erm.. touching. Though watching one get utterly filled in by a couple of bikers was hilarious.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T01:04:19-07:00","id":1462247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462220#post1462220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To be frank, the majority of the **** 1/2star rating comes immediately from the fact that it was absolutely absurd to have to wait as long as we did for a Sabbat supplement. Not only did we have to have the Tzimisce and Lasombra waited on in supplements away from the main book but we also had the Sabbat exiled to nowhere (the Middle East being a place I could reach in a day) as if it wasn't a third pillar sect. The Sabbat main book should have always been one of the original three supplements for V:TM 5th Edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure why &quot;this book should have been front and center, but wasn't,&quot; means it gets an improved rating.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I don't feel comfortable downgrading a book's rating for what it is NOT. Speaking as a guy who reviews books as part of his profession (I review at Booknest.EU and have over 200 reviews there), I feel like you cannot be upset with a book for not being the way you want it. </div> </div> </div>But, it's the 5th edition of an RPG, not a novel. Besides the fact that it's ridiculous to say not to judge something on what it isn't without any context (if I book sells itself as a horror story, and isn't scary, are you going to give it a high rating simply because the prose is still good, and ignore it failing to be what it says it is? And novels that exist as parts of a series get judged negatively all the time for things they lack when it comes to how they interact with the larger setting they're part of), it exists as an update to existing material into a new edition. It's not just there to be read, but to be used by people that want to have the Sabbat in their V5 games. RPG books are tools, not just coffee table books. A beautiful car that can't make it to the end of a block without breaking down should be judged for being a bad car however good it looks, because you're not just reviewing something with form, but with function.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Ratings are always a summary of my overall positivity to a subject and not going to cover all the actual ups and downs of something. What I liked, I liked very much. What I didn't like, I pointed out in the main part of the review. </div> </div> </div>Which is... kinda useless as a reviewing system? &quot;4.5/5 stars because I don't include flaws in my ratings,&quot; doesn't actually tell people how good the book is in total. What's the point of a review that isn't critical (in terms of thinking, not in terms of negativity) and only looks at the positives?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuperSabbatST</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462227#post1462227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm sorry the assement about sabbat, lasombra, and larps is just incorrect.</div> </div> </div> </div>To add to this a bit:<br /> <br /> The perception of Lasombra ATs being popular in LARPs is because LARPs and other large group oriented play have a problem TT style play doesn't: they're large. If you have 100 players, they're going to want ways to differentiate themselves. While every Clan has internal variety, it's natural for players to start looking for unusual options to set their characters apart.<br /> <br /> However, when you're dealing with large group play, you have to keep unusual and rare parts of the game.... well unusual and rare or the tone of the game quickly becomes unmanageable. These things also have a tendency to be disruptive in the wrong hands, and thus there's additional pressure to be careful who gets to play them. So you have to balance things like making sure a few people can to have access to special things (oh the cries of favoritism if you only let one person play a rare Clan or Bloodline member), the need to maintain the feel of the game, and make sure the people that do play them don't abuse the privilege.<br /> <br /> So what happens is that things like Lasombra ATs became desirable and coveted more than actually being popular. Only so many people are going to get to play one in your LARP. And there's a strong psychological pressure in most people to want to grab for the rare stuff if they can get it (after all, if you don't try for the rare you can still play the normal, but if you just play the normal you never get the rare).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T01:07:34-07:00","id":1462248,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462245#post1462245\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Pretty much. Tho it was worse than assholes, and now would be prosecuted (rightly) level of unwanted erm.. touching. Though watching one get utterly filled in by a couple of bikers was hilarious.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that was a horrible thing in a lot of LARPs. Absolutely unacceptable. Sorry you had to go through it and my sympathies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T01:22:44-07:00","id":1462249,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ur-Than</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462238#post1462238\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Except Paths are mostly used to side-step all the difficulties Humanities are meant to put on your Vampire.</div> </div> </div> </div>If a player is just trying to sidestep an aspect of the game, you should consider that this player may want something different from the game. If a proposed experience in the game isn't attracting this player, maybe this player should be allowed to have fun in another way. If the ways players want to have fun aren't compatible and with no compromise, then maybe this particular group shouldn't play yet.<br /> <br /> Those things have nothing to do with Paths or rules.<br /> <br /> Paths add options to the game. They are tools. They can be used in several ways to bring other kinds of horror or drama to the table. They can also be used just as an excuse to ignore an aspect of the game, but if you want to do that you'll find ways to in Humanity too. As an ST or a player, the best way to deal with this is to discuss with your group the matter and decide if and how Paths should work in the game.<br /> <br /> Masquerade's Humanity have little to do with Requiem's Humanity, by the way, especially since Requiem 2nd ed. Despite all the superficial similarities the devil is, indeed, in the details. Same score, similar-but-not-so-much &quot;sins&quot;, other rules for it going up or down, and the incredibly useful rule to get a supernatural weirdness in exchange of ignoring a specific sin. They are worlds apart and Requiem's Humanity is, indeed, wonderful. But don't belong in Masquerade because their themes are similar, but again, the devil is in the details.<br /> <br /> By the way, and that's just an anecdote, I used to be fiercely opposed to Paths. I hated them and the Sabbat as merely shitty stereotypes and power fantasies. With time I learned how much I was wrong, and started to appreciate what they can bring to my games. Yet, for one reason or another, as a player I never used anything but Humanity, not even when playing Sabbat. But other players being on Paths don't really bother me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T01:31:28-07:00","id":1462251,"title":"","content":"The key to Paths for me is this phrase:<br /> <br /> &quot;A Path will free you from the guilt and self-loathing of being a murderous predator. It will destroy your life in every other way.&quot;<br /> <br /> At my table the important part of Path followers is they're every bit as miserable and self-hating as other vampires. They just have it for different reasons. You can't escape the Curse of Caine.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T02:14:46-07:00","id":1462254,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462213#post1462213\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Maybe some Lasombra struck a deal with the Cam so they could defect in large enough numbers to make a headhunt impossible even as a joke.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's what I went with essentially the kings and queens of shadow and a number of disgruntled neonates defected with support of Camarilla keepers when the inquisition turned Sabbat coherence to Hell. The clan main is still Sabbat but has dropped the self indulgant attempts to kill all defectors. The ivory tower was willing to accept them but they're somewhat expected/pressured to fill the brujah/gangrel roles as front line muscle.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462231#post1462231\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;The Cam has all the Sabbat options now so you don't really need the Cam&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div></span></span></span><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462231#post1462231\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Except that ruins the Cam. </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">And we still don't have paths in the Cam</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Well that and the cam (</span></span></span>and anarchs) <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">is nothing like the Sabbat in any context so all you're really talking about is clan. Which h</span></span></span>as been heavily downplayed this edition anyway","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 10-01-2021, 05:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T02:21:05-07:00","id":1462255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462239#post1462239\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You mean paths allow vampires struggling with morality to adapt their moral compass to something more suited for them? You mean this isn't just a parody of how horrible people in real life completely change their own moral outlook in order to suit their own ends? <i>Of fucking course</i> it's going to be used by players to sidestep difficulties of humanity, THAT IS THE POINT. Every time this argument gets brought up, I can't help but think how early man must have dealt with a lot of shit when he developed bowls and spoons and started eating soups, his fellow primitives outraged that he would have the gal to try make life easier for himself.<br /> <br /> IDK about you, I'm not into Torture porn, but given it's a game and we're all relatively responsible people who realize it's such, but if everyone's cool with the torture porn enthusiast at the table, it's fair game, and if not, you should bring it up to the GM. If people enjoy the game, the themes don't matter, torture porn or action extravaganzas are great when everyone's having fun. Maybe the problem is the player who only wants his party to cry rivers of blood and wallow in angst.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> What's the point of playing that game if you can entirely sidestep one of the core mechanics ? I don't play Darksouls because I don't like what it asks from players (commitement, the ability to endure countless death to progress) but it doesn't mean that I'd want an easy mofe in here, I'd rather play another game altogether. The same is true here. If the Paths allows one to largely ignore the core mechanics of the game and replace them by &quot;sins&quot; which almost never will come to bit you in the ass or makes very little sense (if saying &quot;thanks&quot; is equal to murdering a baby in cold blood, you're already doomed to being consumed by your Beast no matter how much you may want to pretend you're not).<br /> <br /> Perhaps it was just the group I was in, and my growing older and remembering the bits I disliked more than the ones I liked, but I really dislike the idea that Paths entirely allow one to drop Humanity because it opens far too many opportunities to just turn the game into something else entirely which wasn't what was advertised. I don't want the Sabbat to be full of inhuman supremacist monsters because it makes them utterly despicable and uninteresting for me (as we got in V5 which is basically a continuation of overpromoting the Paths over Humanity in the sect). And it's what I got in retrospect with the Paths, or they were Humanity by another name (like Honorable Accord which never worked for me because it's really too close from Humanity in my eyes) which, again, goes against what the game advertised itself as.<br /> <br /> It also makes zero sense for Humanity to be this impossible to achieve code of morals leading to wassail no matter what you do to try and cling to it. If it was really that dire, neither the Camarilla nor the Anarchs would be able to endure more than a few decades, and in fact the Vampires wouldn't be able to uphold the Mascarade.<br /> <br /> But maybe it also comes from my own understand of what the &quot;true&quot; Sabbat is : the ranks and files of shovelheads and others, who are basically all on Humanity but have taken to heart the creed to stop Antediluvians from destroying the world, while Pathers are a misguided, often hypocrital if not traitorous, elite who is no better - or worse - than those they opposed. Which is why if I played V5, I'd probably have Europeans Anarchs revitalized by an influx of rank and file former Sabbat having lost the civil war against the Pathers, and extremely willing to deal with them with extreme prejudice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","name":"Ur-Than","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T02:43:11-07:00","id":1462257,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462251#post1462251\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The key to Paths for me is this phrase:<br /> <br /> <br /> At my table the important part of Path followers is they're every bit as miserable and self-hating as other vampires. They just have it for different reasons. You can't escape the Curse of Caine.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> you touch it with <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">a needle, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">my old p</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">ath of night</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> w</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">as once forced under domin</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">ate to openly </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">admit to herself she despised wh</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">at she'd become </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">and</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> w</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">as desper</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">ate for someone to stop her. P</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">aths </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">are </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">negotiated defe</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">at not </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">a victory.</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 10-01-2021, 05:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T02:43:36-07:00","id":1462258,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ur-Than</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462255#post1462255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's the point of playing that game if you can entirely sidestep one of the core mechanics ?</div> </div> </div> </div>To quote the first page of the core rulebook:<br /> &quot;People have different needs and not every method works for every person.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ur-Than</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462255#post1462255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It also makes zero sense for Humanity to be this impossible to achieve code of morals leading to wassail no matter what you do to try and cling to it. If it was really that dire, neither the Camarilla nor the Anarchs would be able to endure more than a few decades, and in fact the Vampires wouldn't be able to uphold the Mascarade.</div> </div> </div> </div>It doesn't. But here we are...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27028-ignithas","name":"Ignithas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T02:59:01-07:00","id":1462259,"title":"","content":"It does make sense though.<br /> Humanity is something <i>humans </i>have. Vampires are just trying to ape it to stave off the Beast and blend in as a predator. That's literally why the Camarilla promotes it over all the other paths vampires used to follow.<br /> <br /> <br /> One of the introductory lines of V1 and V2: Morality is chosen, not Ordained.<br /> So, yeah, pick a path you fool. Humanity as the one true way is Ordaining, All roads being equal give you choice. &quot;A Beast I am Lest a Beast I become&quot; doesn't tell you that you need to stick with humanity (V5 doesn't use that line I don't think?) <br /> <br /> and yeah, the biggest thing is that humans aren't bound to a single morality. Check out prevailing the American mentality that subversive &quot;Cyclists&quot; aren't people so it's ok to pull stunts that risk their lives. Or whatever else isn't currently topical but still fucked up.. People will kill in the name of an anti-violent prophet and pat themselves on the back for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T04:31:24-07:00","id":1462262,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ur-Than</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462255#post1462255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> 1)It also makes zero sense for Humanity to be this impossible to achieve code of morals leading to wassail no matter what you do to try and cling to it. If it was really that dire, neither the Camarilla nor the Anarchs would be able to endure more than a few decades, and in fact the Vampires wouldn't be able to uphold the Mascarade.<br /> <br /> But maybe it also comes from my own understand of what the &quot;true&quot; Sabbat is : the ranks and files of shovelheads and others, who are basically all on Humanity but have taken to heart the creed to stop Antediluvians from destroying the world, while Pathers are a misguided, often hypocrital if not traitorous, elite who is no better - or worse - than those they opposed. Which is why if I played V5, I'd probably have Europeans Anarchs revitalized by an influx of rank and file former Sabbat having lost the civil war against the Pathers, and extremely willing to deal with them with extreme prejudice.</div> </div> </div> </div>1) your right, they should do, and they only don't by author fiat.<br /> <br /> 2) Wrong way round, shovel heads are battle fodder, and the True Sabbat are the Pathers, Trans and post Human beings who don't make a doomed attempt to stay human. <br /> <br /> I don't play Anarch games, or cam games, Humanity holds zero interest for me, but for Vampire RPGs, VtM is basically it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T04:33:15-07:00","id":1462263,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462262#post1462262\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 1) your right, they should do, and they only don't by author fiat.<br /> <br /> 2) Wrong way round, shovel heads are battle fodder, and the True Sabbat are the Pathers, Trans and post Human beings who don't make a doomed attempt to stay human.<br /> <br /> I don't play Anarch games, or cam games, Humanity holds zero interest for me, but for Vampire RPGs, VtM is basically it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well then we clearly have an absolute irreconciliable view of both Humanity and the Sabbat itself. Pathers are not it at all, in fact for me they are the cancer which keeps holding it back with terrible behavior impeding its potential victory.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","name":"Ur-Than","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T04:39:18-07:00","id":1462265,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ur-Than</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462263#post1462263\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Well then we clearly have an absolute irreconciliable view of both Humanity and the Sabbat itself. Pathers are not it at all, in fact for me they are the cancer which keeps holding it back with terrible behavior impeding its potential victory.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I came into the Sabbat with the Players Guide to The Sabbat, in what 1993? So for me Sabbat didn't have Humanity at all until Revised forced it in because certain devs hate the Sabbat..... I also play a lot of VtDA with Roads being how everything was done, and Humanity was just another option. So looking at Humanity it is living a huge lie, pretending to be something you aren't and that never ends well, when the mask cracks you Wassail, Paths don't lie, don't pretend, you are not human, and by any human measure you are not sane...and don't care.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T04:59:03-07:00","id":1462266,"title":"","content":"I've wondered if a lot of problems modern vampires have comes from the collapse of the roads as you know have loads of vampires on humanity who are terrible at it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T05:10:31-07:00","id":1462267,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462251#post1462251\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The key to Paths for me is this phrase:<br /> <br /> &quot;A Path will free you from the guilt and self-loathing of being a murderous predator. It will destroy your life in every other way.&quot;<br /> <br /> At my table the important part of Path followers is they're every bit as miserable and self-hating as other vampires. They just have it for different reasons. You can't escape the Curse of Caine.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think I've ever played a miserable self hating vampire on any path. ( including humanity)<br /> <br /> Maybe occasionally for a night or two in their unlives, but most are fairly content, if not happy...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Prone to being a Classic Curmudgeon, goshdarned whippersnappers...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1037-jamiemalk","name":"jamiemalk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1037_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T05:17:47-07:00","id":1462268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462266#post1462266\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've wondered if a lot of problems modern vampires have comes from the collapse of the roads as you know have loads of vampires on humanity who are terrible at it.</div> </div> </div> </div>It certainly wouldn\u2019t be the first time a large organization self-sabotaged by putting ideology ahead of reality.<br /> <br /> Imagine what the Camarilla might look like if it had determined, say, the ancestor of Honorable Accord* as it\u2019s foundation that fledglings were indoctrinated in until their release as neonates; a system where defying your superior/elders leads to degeneration and so is to be avoided and Anarchs only exist from unsanctioned embraces that dangerously try to hold onto their Humanity.<br /> <br /> * I chose Honorable Accord specifically because it retains both the natural human virtues of Conscience and Self-Control and so is much less difficult to indoctrinate someone into\u2026 same virtues, but different priorities (someone once told me that for trying to roleplay Honorable Accord, the biggest difference between the two is that Humanity favors Conscience, Honorable Accord favors Self-Control).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T05:36:19-07:00","id":1462270,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462268#post1462268\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It certainly wouldn\u2019t be the first time a large organization self-sabotaged by putting ideology ahead of reality.<br /> <br /> Imagine what the Camarilla might look like if it had determined, say, the ancestor of Honorable Accord* as it\u2019s foundation that fledglings were indoctrinated in until their release as neonates; a system where defying your superior/elders leads to degeneration and so is to be avoided and Anarchs only exist from unsanctioned embraces that dangerously try to hold onto their Humanity.<br /> <br /> * I chose Honorable Accord specifically because it retains both the natural human virtues of Conscience and Self-Control and so is much less difficult to indoctrinate someone into\u2026 same virtues, but different priorities (someone once told me that for trying to roleplay Honorable Accord, the biggest difference between the two is that Humanity favors Conscience, Honorable Accord favors Self-Control).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That would have been Chivalry, and it was one of the Humane Roads.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T06:10:43-07:00","id":1462273,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuperSabbatST</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462233#post1462233\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would have had all 3 sects be playable and not so much at each other's throats so you could allow for cross sect interaction between players. .</div> </div> </div> </div>Technically there are three playable sects, it's just the Sabbat isn't one of them...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27090-jonny","name":"Jonny","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T07:23:25-07:00","id":1462277,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462251#post1462251\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The key to Paths for me is this phrase:<br /> <br /> &quot;A Path will free you from the guilt and self-loathing of being a murderous predator. It will destroy your life in every other way.&quot;<br /> <br /> At my table the important part of Path followers is they're every bit as miserable and self-hating as other vampires. They just have it for different reasons. You can't escape the Curse of Caine.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that seems about right, or at least close to it. At the core of the game is the vampire fighting against the Beast. That's the eternal struggle that every vampire engages in every night, whether they're a shovelhead who crawled out of the grave thirty minutes ago or an Antediluvian. Being on a Path doesn't change that - vampires on Paths still struggle against their Beast. They still regret their mistakes and feel guilt for their failings. Of course their guilt and failings are different from vampires who still cling to their humanity but they're still there.<br /> <br /> A vampire on the Path of Death and Soul might feel incredibly guilty after killing someone, not for killing them but because they had to kill them in self-defense and then flee and didn't have the opportunity to properly observe their death. A vampire on the Path of Power and the Inner Voice might not feel bad for killing, but would feel a great deal of guilt about the time he allowed another to gain power over him. A vampire on the Path of Honorable Accord would feel himself losing to his Beast for breaking his word.<br /> <br /> Vampires on Paths still struggle, still feel guilt, still experience personal horror. They do so differently from humans but they've embraced the fact that they're not human. And any vampire on a Path <i>is</i> struggling. There's no &quot;Path of Doing Whatever I Want Whenever I Want.&quot; Any vampire who tries that will quickly fall to their Beast. Any vampire player who tried to take a Path to sidestep problems wouldn't get very far since the ST would simply introduce scenarios that would be a problem for that Path follower.<br /> <br /> And all that isn't getting into the fact that some Paths are <i>harder</i> to follow than Humanity. And for many it isn't even all that much easier to to kill or such - in many Paths murder or casual killing are still in the Sin 1-4 range at around the same level as Humanity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T07:52:46-07:00","id":1462278,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462270#post1462270\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That would have been Chivalry, and it was one of the Humane Roads.</div> </div> </div> </div>Right. It\u2019s probably the least \u201calien\u201d of the paths in the modern setting, to the point that I could see certain actual mortal humans on that path. There are plenty of real world professions and cultures that place honor and duty ahead of compassion for others (which seems to be the core sin of Humanity).<br /> <br /> And I do think honor and duty probably better resist the Beast than compassion, because its right there in the word Com- (share) -Passion (powerful feelings). It\u2019s a lot easier to flip a positive passion into a negative one and end up doing something horrible in the heat of passion than to move someone emotionally detached to act.<br /> <br /> Frankly, in the vampire corner of the WoD the only ones who are really safe on Humanity are ghouls, revenants and dhampirs precisely because they can\u2019t lose that last dot. Similarly, if werewolves had to be on Humanity they\u2019d wassail in a week\u2026 something like Path of Harmony would pretty much be required to keep them from becoming a mindless beast.<br /> <br /> As much as I prefer Humanity (there\u2019s a reason I only play Dhampirs on the rare occasions I get to actually play) I don\u2019t think \u201cHumanity is for Humans\u201d is even that hard of a sell for vampires. They\u2019re objectively not human and so long as the alternative has some sort of alignment with the vampiric condition (some of the the paths are clearly more propaganda driven; ex. Typhon).<br /> <br /> My personal feeling is that \u201cHarmony\u201d is probably the most \u2018natural\u2019 for vampires as it embraces their predatory nature and even includes a practical morality that can appeal to former human psyche of avoiding killing humans (because a dead human can only be fed from once).<br /> <br /> Honorable Accord is probably next best as it has less issue with the violence that predation of humans will inevitably result in, and has better tools in its focus on duty and honor over feelings for resisting the passions of the Beast.<br /> <br /> Humanity is probably number three on my list, mainly because the general principles are natural to who the vampire used to be, making it a great \u201cstarter set\u201d (and that is all some people actually need). However, I think it is, bar none, the STUPIDEST system of morality to hold onto in conjunction with the Masquerade; a system that requires you to feed in ways that violate others because allowing them full consent would be a Masquerade breach and which requires manipulating and even killing others in order to protect it if there is a breach.<br /> <br /> Humanity would work fantastically if vampires were allowed to assemble fully consensual human herds (it is pleasurable after all) or to buy blood (eliminating the theft aspect) from consenting mortals. But that\u2019s a Masquerade mess and so the sect most likely to be ON Humanity is also the sect whose policies are the most corrosive TO Humanity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T10:16:56-07:00","id":1462288,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462247#post1462247\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not sure why &quot;this book should have been front and center, but wasn't,&quot; means it gets an improved rating.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a correction of a massive flaw in V5. I would not be the huge V5 fan if not for OPP fixing most of the problems but they couldn't handle the Sabbat issue. Now most of my issues with V5 are fixed.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> But, it's the 5th edition of an RPG, not a novel. Besides the fact that it's ridiculous to say not to judge something on what it isn't without any context (if I book sells itself as a horror story, and isn't scary, are you going to give it a high rating simply because the prose is still good, and ignore it failing to be what it says it is? And novels that exist as parts of a series get judged negatively all the time for things they lack when it comes to how they interact with the larger setting they're part of), it exists as an update to existing material into a new edition. It's not just there to be read, but to be used by people that want to have the Sabbat in their V5 games. RPG books are tools, not just coffee table books. A beautiful car that can't make it to the end of a block without breaking down should be judged for being a bad car however good it looks, because you're not just reviewing something with form, but with function. </div> </div> </div>It's a case of where they said what the book was going to be at the start and didn't deviate from that. They said it was an antagonists book and never said otherwise or implied otherwise. So I think I have to judge it on the context of a Sabbat antagonist book versus a Sabbat player book.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Which is... kinda useless as a reviewing system? &quot;4.5/5 stars because I don't include flaws in my ratings,&quot; doesn't actually tell people how good the book is in total. What's the point of a review that isn't critical (in terms of thinking, not in terms of negativity) and only looks at the positives? </div> </div> </div>The rating is just a shorthand for whether I liked the book or not and how much I enjoy it. The actual point of the review is the text.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T10:17:49-07:00","id":1462289,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1171889/9289919-v5-sabbat-the-black-hand-part-1\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.buzzsprout.com/1171889/9...ck-hand-part-1</a><br /> <br /> 25 Years of V:TM have reviewed the book and REALLY love it.<br /> <br /> &quot;If a Sabbat is on a Path of Humanity, you'd just be an Anarch.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T11:11:58-07:00","id":1462295,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462289#post1462289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1171889/9289919-v5-sabbat-the-black-hand-part-1\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.buzzsprout.com/1171889/9...ck-hand-part-1</a><br /> <br /> 25 Years of V:TM have reviewed the book and REALLY love it.<br /> <br /> &quot;If a Sabbat is on a Path of Humanity, you'd just be an Anarch.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> wow, they make it sound like WW took the largest dump in human history on everyone who ever liked the Sabbat, they are trying to make it sound like a good thing, but damn. All the interesting things are gone, all the character, they are just WoD orcs. So all we have left are the utterly boring anarchs, which in the entire history of the setting have worked for nothing and won everything.... or the Cam.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 10-01-2021, 02:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T11:18:35-07:00","id":1462298,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462265#post1462265\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So for me Sabbat didn't have Humanity at all until Revised forced it in because certain devs hate the Sabbat.....</div> </div> </div> </div>For the same reason that not giving Paths in the V5 Sabbat book hurts the game, not giving Humanity in the Sabbat before Revised hurt the game in the past. It was one of the best decisions of Revised, among many dubious ones, because it increases options for Players and Storytellers.<br /> <br /> Bringing out of the character the argument that vampires shouldn't exist on Humanity is simply stupid. Vampires are fictional characters that were human in their formation years in-character and played by humans out-of-character. It is perfectly possible to play on Humanity and have a successful character as many players can attest to it, and indeed it is impossible to even say what a truly inhuman mindset would even look like.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462268#post1462268\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Imagine what the Camarilla might look like if it had determined, say, the ancestor of Honorable Accord* as it\u2019s foundation that fledglings were indoctrinated in</div> </div> </div> </div>They would fail.<br /> <br /> Humanity isn't the primary Path because fledglings are indoctrinated on it. It is the primary Path because we live in a humanist society. EVERYONE is indoctrinated on it. It is in our education systems and media. Some parts of it are the natural wiring of our brains (like not killing another human). Most social norms, family values and religious teachings gravitate toward it even when they don't follow it to the letter.<br /> <br /> So it is at least familiar to everyone and already natural to most. People that come from life already wired for another Path are a minority, sizable but a minority. So in this sense Humanity as a Path is a logical, pragmatic decision by the Camarilla. Going for anything else in modern society would be too ineffective as a strategy.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462277#post1462277\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And for many it isn't even all that much easier to to kill or such - in many Paths murder or casual killing are still in the Sin 1-4 range at around the same level as Humanity.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's another important aspect. Many Paths don't exactly let you ignore Humanity, they give you pretty narrow exception cases. You can do stuff when fulfilling the Path's obligations, not whenever you fancy it. And many are indeed harder, because they lack &quot;accident&quot; clauses, you're never allowed to do that no matter what. And even if you're low in the Path, the social pressure for you to follow the higher standards is far greater than in Humanity. You're not seen as evil, you're seen as weak, a failure, so you're pressed always into following at least the equivalent to 6 or 7 to the best of your ability.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T11:45:04-07:00","id":1462302,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462295#post1462295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">wow, they make it sound like WW took the largest dump in human history on everyone who ever liked the Sabbat, they are trying to make it sound like a good thing, but damn. All the interesting things are gone, all the character, they are just WoD orcs. So all we have left are the utterly boring anarchs, which in the entire history of the setting have worked for nothing and won everything.... or the Cam.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, they're predominately Sabbat fans and utterly loathe the Anarchs so it was probably meant as an insult to the latter. I was honestly stunned they had such a positive opinion of the book and agreed with me on every point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T11:47:08-07:00","id":1462303,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462302#post1462302\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean, they're predominately Sabbat fans and utterly loathe the Anarchs so it was probably meant as an insult to the latter. I was honestly stunned they had such a positive opinion of the book and agreed with me on every point.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I was going off listening to the review, they were right about the Sabbat on Humanity just being anarchs... but the review of the contents...damn WW hate us.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 10-01-2021, 02:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T11:53:05-07:00","id":1462306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462303#post1462303\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was going off listening to the review, they were right about the Sabbat on Humanity just being anarchs... but the review of the contents...damn WW hate us.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think there's any sign WW hates you or other Sabbat players.<br /> <br /> It's just an ST book that sadly doesn't contain content for playing Sabbat. Not an attack on them. Its the Storytellers Guide to the Sabbat not the Players Guide.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462298#post1462298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's another important aspect. Many Paths don't exactly let you ignore Humanity, they give you pretty narrow exception cases. You can do stuff when fulfilling the Path's obligations, not whenever you fancy it. And many are indeed harder, because they lack &quot;accident&quot; clauses, you're never allowed to do that no matter what. And even if you're low in the Path, the social pressure for you to follow the higher standards is far greater than in Humanity. You're not seen as evil, you're seen as weak, a failure, so you're pressed always into following at least the equivalent to 6 or 7 to the best of your ability.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which always felt like a dodge to me because the Sabbat IS the organization of vampires who don't kill for money or power or fun. The reason they exist is to make sure it's clear there are vampires who utterly revel in the Beast and behave in the kind of horror movie terrifying fashion that other vampires generally avoid. They're the guys who fill the Jason Voorhees, Freddy Krueger, and House of a 1000 Corpses niche.<br /> <br /> It was why the Path of Harmony never quite jived.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 10-01-2021, 02:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T11:56:19-07:00","id":1462307,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462306#post1462306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't think there's any sign WW hates you or other Sabbat players.<br /> <br /> It's just an ST book that sadly doesn't contain content for playing Sabbat. Not an attack on them. Its the Storytellers Guide to the Sabbat not the Players Guide.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Except the entire state of the Sabbat right now...and the destruction of the Path system...and the statements by the devs...and the entire conviction/touchstone system...and th Lasombra and Tzimisce...and I am sure I missed some things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T12:09:28-07:00","id":1462308,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462307#post1462307\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Except the entire state of the Sabbat right now...and the destruction of the Path system...and the statements by the devs...and the entire conviction/touchstone system...and th Lasombra and Tzimisce...and I am sure I missed some things.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Path system is back. We just don't have rules for it.<br /> <br /> The Sabbat are also back and not destroyed.<br /> <br /> I consider those plusses.<br /> <br /> Conviction/Touchstones have nothing to do with Sabbat.<br /> <br /> And what about the Lasombra/Tzimisce?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T12:10:12-07:00","id":1462309,"title":"","content":"I find the reshuffle of sects to be the absolute most boring scenario we could've possibly had. The only thing that makes it interesting is the outrageous circumstances that have forced the changes.<br /> <br /> The Anarchs are winning and aren't underdogs and that was their whole shtick. You want to pretend to be the Rebel Alliance but now It's like pretending you're the Resistance fighting the First Order alone but there's a republic behind you now...<br /> The Cam went from the nuanced all-encompassing yet rather hands-off Government to the Enclave (but without the cool technology, post apocalyptic reclamation scheme, or any mandate to rule)<br /> The Sabbat are... orcs. Their interesting traits prostituted to the nuCamarilla<br /> The Settites have been subsumed into other factions.<br /> The necromancers have doubled down on sitting in the corner and not interacting with anyone.<br /> It seems The Assamites don't have their own sect anymore.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T12:14:27-07:00","id":1462310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462308#post1462308\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Path system is back. We just don't have rules for it.<br /> <br /> The Sabbat are also back and not destroyed.<br /> <br /> I consider those plusses.<br /> <br /> Conviction/Touchstones have nothing to do with Sabbat.<br /> <br /> And what about the Lasombra/Tzimisce?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The Path system is at best a pale mockery of what it was, The sabbat have lost all the factions, territory and politics, as well as insanely going to mono path packs, So.. those aren't pluses, those are in name only. <br /> <br /> Conviction/Touchstones are the morality system, as disgusting as they are. <br /> <br /> The lasombra ate the idiot stella mass black hole, the Tzim lost their identity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T12:16:24-07:00","id":1462311,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462310#post1462310\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Path system is at best a pale mockery of what it was, The sabbat have lost all the factions, territory and politics, as well as insanely going to mono path packs, So.. those aren't pluses, those are in name only.</div> </div> </div> </div>The factions are now the Paths. They also have lost a lot of territory but they still have territory. They have Archbishops and Bishops after all.<br /> <br /> There's also many mixed Paths packs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T12:30:40-07:00","id":1462312,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462311#post1462311\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The factions are now the Paths. They also have lost a lot of territory but they still have territory. They have Archbishops and Bishops after all.<br /> <br /> There's also many mixed Paths packs.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Except the factions don't track onto Paths... and it was stated to be a deliberate choice to 'hollow out the Sabbat' . <br /> <br /> Mixed Path Packs never got mentioned, so I will take your word for that,.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T12:38:47-07:00","id":1462313,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462306#post1462306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think there's any sign WW hates you or other Sabbat players.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't take everything as a sign that WW hate the Sabbat, but I do take the initial state of the Sabbat in the edition and the time and conditions for them to come back as clear evidence that Paradox does. And I'm not just talking about the lack of rules, but both the sheer time for the book to come and the fact that it has a low page count and as much warnings that they are NPCs-only as physically possible.<br /> <br /> Those are, to my recon, signs that Paradox indeed hate the Sabbat. Everything else is just their narrative choices, make what you may of their quality. I am EXTREMELY offended by their take on the Sabbat, for reasons already discussed <i>ad nauseam</i>, but in no way by thinking it is an indication of hating the fictional faction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T13:12:50-07:00","id":1462315,"title":"","content":"When I first started playing I really didn't know why the Tzmisce and cam wouldn't mix at all with basically no exceptions. Sure the Tzmisce care for sovereignty, but the cam doesn't really get in the face of local princes all that much. It just seemed like it would be good for all parties involved. The Tzmisce get peace and the Cam get surgeons. <br /> <br /> But the exclusion is wise. <br /> <br /> From a Doylist point of view, plastic surgeons undermine all that draconian emphasis on the maasquerade. Also it just seems a bit too modern for immortal, unchanging vampires to be getting nose jobs every now and then. <br /> From a Watsonian point of view, Vicissitude is literally considered a horrific disease concocted by evil spirtual aliens from another dimesnsion, but more seriously it's a torture discipline that's left scars, and more practically speaking it's a <u>massive masquerade liability </u>even when used correctly (since it's permanent and can be held up as evidence) and, y'know, bigotry between clans is a thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T13:35:38-07:00","id":1462318,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462315#post1462315\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When I first started playing I really didn't know why the Tzmisce and cam wouldn't mix at all with basically no exceptions. Sure the Tzmisce care for sovereignty, but the cam doesn't really get in the face of local princes all that much. It just seemed like it would be good for all parties involved. The Tzmisce get peace and the Cam get surgeons.<br /> <br /> But the exclusion is wise.<br /> <br /> From a Doylist point of view, plastic surgeons undermine all that draconian emphasis on the maasquerade. Also it just seems a bit too modern for immortal, unchanging vampires to be getting nose jobs every now and then.<br /> From a Watsonian point of view, Vicissitude is literally considered a horrific disease concocted by evil spirtual aliens from another dimesnsion, but more seriously it's a torture discipline that's left scars, and more practically speaking it's a <u>massive masquerade liability </u>even when used correctly (since it's permanent and can be held up as evidence) and, y'know, bigotry between clans is a thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean the Doylist perspective has always been something that has bugged me about the Tzimisce. Fleshcrafters are absolutely something the Camarilla should have on tap.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T14:17:19-07:00","id":1462323,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462289#post1462289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;If a Sabbat is on a Path of Humanity, you'd just be an Anarch.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>[Bites lip, pinches nose bridge, considers words]<br /> <br /> That's a very......dismissive...... attitude to both Anarchs and Sabbat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 10-01-2021, 08:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T15:35:07-07:00","id":1462328,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462288#post1462288\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a correction of a massive flaw in V5. I would not be the huge V5 fan if not for OPP fixing most of the problems but they couldn't handle the Sabbat issue. Now most of my issues with V5 are fixed.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, to be clear, you're willing to give stars to V5 Sabbat for something it isn't (timely)?<br /> <br /> Because this doesn't feel like a consistent standard.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> So I think I have to judge it on the context of a Sabbat antagonist book versus a Sabbat player book. </div> </div> </div>Plenty of the flaws you have directly stated exist in the book apply to an antagonist focused book.<br /> <br /> The lack of Path rules makes it harder for STs to know how to handle Paths when the PCs interact with Path vampires. If the PCs feel like they can't take a Sabbat pack head on, and want to weaken the pack's leader by undermining his Path (like you can by attacking an NPC's Touchstones to undermine their Humanity) the ST is forced to adjudicate this on the fly as there are no mechanics to base the attempt on.<br /> <br /> The lack of Loresheets means there isn't a good way for players to buy into Sabbat focused stories by adding connections to the Sabbat (former Sabbat members, a sire that's still Sabbat even if the PC isn't, etc.).<br /> <br /> The lack of information on an number of key topics to the Sabbat so STs can understand the Sect's updates.<br /> <br /> The short book and high price.<br /> <br /> All of these things are negatives for an antagonist focused book doing the job its supposed to do.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T15:47:32-07:00","id":1462333,"title":"","content":"i havent read through 23 pages of comments but does the metaplot progress in any way? I am sucker for the lore. BJD is basically my favorite book in WOD! Do we get to know who or what is behind the beckoning? or the current state of the antedilluvians? Are the sabbat gorgin themselves on ante blood like previously hinted? Perhaps some of our favorite methuselahs make a cameo?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24527-blackshade","name":"blackshade","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"224"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T15:59:12-07:00","id":1462336,"title":"","content":"There's certainly metaplot progress in the book, but I don't believe it answers many of those specific questions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T16:01:45-07:00","id":1462337,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462328#post1462328\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So, to be clear, you're willing to give stars to V5 Sabbat for something it isn't (timely)?<br /> <br /> Because this doesn't feel like a consistent standard.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm giving it stars because it's a correction of a major failing of the gameline. Why would I punish it for the problem it fixed?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T16:31:25-07:00","id":1462347,"title":"","content":"My point, is that you're not holding yourself to a consistent standard. You're giving the book stars because of context outside the book itself, but not docking it stars for the same.<br /> <br /> Your defense against a lower rating despite all of the faults you find in the product, is because you don't want to penalize it for things it &quot;isn't.&quot; But it isn't a, &quot;fix a major problems in V5 book,&quot; it's the Sabbat book. If &quot;fixing a major failing of the gameline&quot; is something you'll consider, then so should all the stuff that didn't make it into the books that you agree should have been in the book.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T16:47:43-07:00","id":1462352,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462347#post1462347\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My point, is that you're not holding yourself to a consistent standard. You're giving the book stars because of context outside the book itself, but not docking it stars for the same.<br /> <br /> Your defense against a lower rating despite all of the faults you find in the product, is because you don't want to penalize it for things it &quot;isn't.&quot; But it isn't a, &quot;fix a major problems in V5 book,&quot; it's the Sabbat book. If &quot;fixing a major failing of the gameline&quot; is something you'll consider, then so should all the stuff that didn't make it into the books that you agree should have been in the book.</div> </div> </div> </div>So noted. Thanks for taking the time to point it out. I appreciate the feedback.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T17:23:17-07:00","id":1462362,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462061#post1462061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Now I'm picturing the Path of Honorable Accord getting discredited because of a massive uprising of the Salubri Antritribu that did a huge amount of damage to the sect, perhaps destroying the old Black Hand.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even with the Sabbat Inquisition's aid (them having been described as the premiere proponents of the Path in some of the material, iirc), I see picking that fight being far more likely to go the other way. Which, with both the Inquisition and the Salubri <i>antitribu</i> apparently MIA and the distinction between the Sabbat as a whole and its paramilitary arm being muddied, might very well be how events played out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T17:35:32-07:00","id":1462365,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462362#post1462362\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Even with the Sabbat Inquisition's aid (them having been described as the premiere proponents of the Path in some of the material, iirc), I see picking that fight being far more likely to go the other way. Which, with both the Inquisition and the Salubri <i>antitribu</i> apparently MIA and the distinction between the Sabbat as a whole and its paramilitary arm being muddied, might very well be how events played out.</div> </div> </div> </div>That was a thing Bob pointed out that the Black Hand was always the group that ACTUALLY wanted to kill the Antediluvians and had that as their priority. Part of why when the True Hand was discovered that Jalan was like, &quot;These guys have to go.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T17:46:50-07:00","id":1462366,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackshade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462333#post1462333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i havent read through 23 pages of comments but does the metaplot progress in any way? I am sucker for the lore. BJD is basically my favorite book in WOD! Do we get to know who or what is behind the beckoning? or the current state of the antedilluvians? Are the sabbat gorgin themselves on ante blood like previously hinted? Perhaps some of our favorite methuselahs make a cameo?</div> </div> </div> </div>Read the first 2 or 3 pages. IIRC they will give most of it.<br /> <br /> But to answer your specific questions, no, no, no and no.<br /> <br /> And I do think that the first two should be a yes at this point, not necessarily on this book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T18:36:46-07:00","id":1462373,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461282-my-review-of-sabbat-the-black-hand-4-5-5?p=1462366#post1462366\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Read the first 2 or 3 pages. IIRC they will give most of it.<br /> <br /> But to answer your specific questions, no, no, no and no.<br /> <br /> And I do think that the first two should be a yes at this point, not necessarily on this book.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean the Sabbat certainly think the Beckoning is the Antediluvians. They also believe none of the Antediluvians have died (no mention of Ravnos at all). They also are no more suped-up on Ancient blood than usual.<br /> <br /> But my favorite Methuselahs -- Vykos and Lucita DO make cameos!","signature":"<hr class=\